  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRC Version: 2022.1.1\nDescription: OSC in some worlds will cause your avatar to not follow you correctly. This will show you as invisible in lots of game worlds that teleport you. This happens even if your current avatar has nothing using OSC, just as long as it's enabled in menu.\nRecreation: I can simulate this by enabling OSC and playing in the game world \"Ghost\". Upon start of the game your avatar will become locked to a certain spot and you will still be moving around as a ghost. Your ghost is also not selectable during this time.",
